I've finished a port of NetHack to the ST. It seems to work reasonably
well (i.e. it only crashes once in every three games:-), so I was thinking
of distributing it.
However, it is not the most recent version of NetHack, but the previous
one.

So, I have a couple of questions:
- Are people interested? I'll post an ARCed binary to comp.sys.atari.binaries
  if there is enough interest.
- Is there someone acting as a clearinghouse for NetHack? I.e. could I send
  my fixes somewhere to have them incorporated in the next official
  NetHack release?
  
Please answer by mail, not news.
